  "id": "opamp_noninverting_gain",
  "name": "Op-amp amplifier, gain of 2",
  "category": "signal",
  "description": "A non-inverting MCP6002 stage on 3.3 V: gain = 1 + RF/RG = 2, so 0.8 V in gives 1.6 V out.",
  "notes": "Keep the output below the supply: input × gain must stay under about 3.25 V here. CB is the supply bypass the datasheet asks for: place it within 2 mm of pin 8 (datasheet p.14).",
